{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56557","headline":"还丹口诀 · 董大仙","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日魂月魄无形状，采得天然太新样。\n契合神仙实难论，云霄起在黄芽上。\n龙腾虎伏变金田，始末须得出世铅。\n爲家爲屋自然居，配俪之时顷刻间。\n认得离胎争欲言，不在文书口诀传。\n（《大还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"董大仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}